      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, top margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>...</li>\n<li>...</li>\n<li>I had mentioned to him (i.e., you) in my previous letter</li>\n<li>the situation of our coreligionists the glassmakers</li>\n<li>who are in the Fayy\u016bm and the worry that has flowed into my heart</li>\n<li>&nbsp;on their account constantly. I had asked him (i.e., you) &mdash;</li>\n<li>and I now renew my request of him &mdash;</li>\n<li>to mediate among them</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
